      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it just feels so calculated. like, the cafeteria change happened the same week they started \"accidentally\" leaving me off email chains for meetings i'm supposed to be in. it's like they're trying to make me invisible. do you think there's a way to show that these aren't just random mistakes but part of a pattern? like, how would i argue that the timing of these things proves it's an intentional campaign to push me out?",
